{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>He and his children with him.</b> R. Shimon said: If he himself was sold, who sold his children? Rather, from here [we learn] that his master is obligated to provide food for his children (Kiddushin 22)." "<b>And to the holding of his fathers.</b> To the honor of his fathers — and one must not treat him lightly on this account (Sifra; Mekhilta 13)." "<b>Holding.</b> Possession."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:26.475418864Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}